{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:30 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與舊愛老婆同框零芥蒂  大方賀祁文傑生日  曾稱關係如謝賢狄波拉：分開依然是家人\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/427f675227e1815ee75074fd49478aad/2026-10/20261018__ENT__.png\"/>\n<p>57歲的陳淑蘭近日於社交平台分享與舊愛祁文傑夫婦慶生合照，三人同框畫面非常融洽，毫無芥蒂。當晚陳淑蘭身穿明艷的白色喱士上衣，手持精緻甜點對鏡頭展露燦爛笑容，桌上放著寫有「Happy Birthday」的蛋糕，氣氛歡樂。陳淑蘭曾形容自己與祁文傑的關係就如謝賢與狄波拉，即使有緣無分做不成夫妻，依然是能互相信任成為交心摯友，如今更能大方與祁太同框，大讚對方幸福美滿，友情早已昇華到另一層次。</p>\n<h2>陳淑蘭曾赴九寨溝賀舊愛嫁女</h2>\n<p>陳淑蘭對祁文傑家人的關愛，早已超越普通朋友，甚至比親人更親近。去年11月，她便專程飛往四川九寨溝，出席祁文傑女兒Jane的盛大戶外婚禮，親眼見證新娘子披上婚紗、挽著爸爸手臂進場的溫馨畫面。陳淑蘭不僅為升格外父的祁文傑感到高興，更感性地在社交平台貼上多張家庭相並說：「恭喜祁家，三喜臨門。祁先生嫁女、舊曆生日、契新抱生日，多謝能給我沾上好福氣一齊慶祝。我同祁先生雖然曾是有情人但最終不能眷屬，但我們依然是一家人。有孝順的契仔和新抱、孫子，我好happy能有呢個福氣。懂得感恩，任何角色你都會有嗰份喜悅！」</p>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與祁文傑拍拖初期經常放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/45646072e342f5b6fef21fdc7c2dc3b1/2023-10/DCENT53010052004.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與祁文傑最後因性格不合分手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/89a493f8fb9215a431b8c251ba764f97/2023-10/enp17p06021003.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭到四川九寨溝，出席前男友祁文傑女兒Jane的婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e452f537e4b93081a5cfd588acce138b/2025-11/14_1_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭送上祝福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d5069209f5e776f6663dcf64b658b2b/2025-11/19_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日陳淑蘭（右）與前度祁文傑（中）及其太太（左）一同慶祝生日，手持點心俏皮合照，氣氛溫馨融洽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7f3c628cb56d3af0ce451c6faf63e94/2026-10/843367775_1718783303588602_5581624653044469410_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與祁文傑夫婦慶生，三人同框的畫面盡顯超越愛情，昇華為家人關係。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4d6fbedd78183dd23ea202a982a6d49/2026-10/843534822_1718783196921946_8910906173623249021_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與祁文傑分手後仍會一同出席活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/de2c178d1e2b24a7741bc43cd087c8e0/2023-10/enp21p03150202.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與祁文傑分手後仍是朋友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8e98dde3d7fc7b5a2d7c41c0843f6c17/2023-10/enp13p03050202.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑的感情生活多姿多采。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/89fdd76a88d2b1840ce9efeb8248b4ef/2023-10/enp20p08230202.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭自認揀男人有一手，分手後大部分前度仍然是朋友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/56aea81e8e25a560ab81845ce975e361/2023-10/DCENT81007032005.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與前度祁文傑一家感情很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/039531335c0bf1c72bf511cd596ada9b/2025-08/525009347_1293352466131690_7719621671573873784_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"關係比家人還要親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38975fc65f5521aa0b8b2c1461f6a85d/2025-08/525311393_1293352472798356_8679946310444030082_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭有仔有新抱和孫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf7991281e53b6e02fbfc2a9bb81e4ce/2025-08/525422635_1293352539465016_3040673867094802031_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭又自爆家有喜事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2189fe44d1f8bf894ed5f75ea05bbd75/2025-10/c1_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭又自爆家有喜事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/12af312fa75d38f04fca01600f260cfb/2025-10/c2_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭又自爆家有喜事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eebd3144675b34c6e6cc943ed9df87d2/2025-10/c3_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭又自爆家有喜事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/375bd7480223ca80f0ab33865d5fba92/2025-10/c4_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭又自爆家有喜事，祈文傑嫁女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71ac885057d305a0025ab543b05ce4e5/2025-10/c5_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭又自爆家有喜事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44632145012588fa8640488b15a72859/2025-10/c6_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭感情生活零着落。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb92fe840f18ac5cc8204ad2c3cacee5/2025-08/526580181_1293352506131686_5503927619976476395_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與「孫仔」感情很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2854b37bc4755f789f69f3c19872ebf9/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_01_445.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭榮升做嫲嫲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26b8cb41960e32fbbf936e8b1fdad249/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_03_094.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭獲祁文傑親自下廚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c94e15a30130dc0f9393e71337f6913f/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_16_567.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與前度祁文傑關係很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/433bc1f84e857d153d4a8f47f2601c4b/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_21_263.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭保養得宜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e25493729aa2095c51424dd34e62646b/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_26_866.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭的「新抱」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df8ef09135018c7d3518b7aa9fdb11d8/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_30_113.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與「孫仔」感情很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0258b1544d6dacb6d980832fbae763a/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_34_817.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭自認受寵苦驚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/585ee94bdb08f8d5f6886a8b334b67cc/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_53_479.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭心情愉快。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46e28a0f8ec79d1de39e6391413a3dde/2025-08/chan_mp4_snapshot_00_56_624.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與祁文傑會間中約食飯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b692eb986bb47c574305aa009c87c621/2024-10/66_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭希望與祁文傑的關係似謝賢和狄波拉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/390cffc315d003f832f9ed8b1c92d79b/2023-07/SHEILA_09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭2023年為前度祁文傑慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e077e25ccd4c8df3810bc9f4c7a8e73/2023-10/386381394_779522230848052_6255394571576285595_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與翁虹為祁文傑慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2aadac45fba4199646da38a082e98cd9/2023-10/387695196_779522174181391_565166465822176807_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭吻賀壽星仔祁文傑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8419c3f54a47490b67d8b04c1c962f6c/2023-10/386480833_2317519455125054_5782816164757519343_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑很有艷福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/589ff036b80909a96a5c250c60fde97a/2023-10/387136194_779522157514726_7545778793878284484_n.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳淑蘭自豪揀好男人有一手</h2>\n<p>回顧二人昔日戀情，當年陳淑蘭為了追求漫畫家祁文傑，曾努力惡補漫畫知識，兩人於1996年正式拍拖，可惜最終因性格不合分開，然而這段逝去的戀情卻轉化為親情。陳淑蘭曾自認「揀男人有一手」：「以前啲人覺得我係傻大姐，其實我唔係傻，我揀好男人有一手，所以就算做唔成夫妻都可以做朋友，好似祁文傑咁，佢的確好好，但大家真係冇緣分，點解分手就唔可以做朋友呢？佢哋係好好嘅人，唔做朋友係我嘅損失。」</p>\n<h2>陳淑蘭曾與樂壇天王、富豪拍拖</h2>\n<p>陳淑蘭身為1988年港姐亞軍兼最上鏡小姐，情史相當豐富，可惜情路坎坷。除了祁文傑外，她也曾與型男方中信、樂壇天王黎明以及富豪利承武拍過拖，無奈幾段戀情最終都無疾而終，至今感情仍未有着落，現時視舊愛祁文傑一家如親人，不時共享天倫。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭（左）於1988年當選港姐亞軍，同屆冠軍是李嘉欣、季軍為張郁蕾（右）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d78fbd65279eb1913244b93afd63406b/2022-12/EST2018925007341014M.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭當選後簽約TVB，向主持界發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e6c22a355d0f622f9230147725eae26/2022-12/18698418_1932240397060694_5840829834203751680_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭在《家有囍事》中飾演情婦，令人印象深刻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06b6e5c49d3c63d90a627f723d15ddce/2022-12/php7hnifu_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭於1991年喪父，之後患有廣泛性焦慮症。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d7c0e8c86d8c18a6bcbb1801ea72752/2022-12/266922703_3146476078970447_2049549137210084362_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭2022年5月喪母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c078b78867292781b91901c2eee15cf/2022-12/EST2017510007320099M.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭又試過用電動吸耳器，自行清耳垢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56cdd2246dbd870e1e2f66890d3f5c0d/2022-12/67c3a967gy1gf8gxwo91aj20yi22ohdz.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭與富商利承武的緋聞，傳足14年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bcb55320343aa7ff8b4b2dabae0a7fe2/2022-12/EST201859007335780M.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭分手後，其感情生活未有再公開，間中只約友人見面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da33c94b528adfca37ba68fa5bc02506/2022-12/270369827_3154115278206527_6634652823362512904_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭現時享受生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b0801a5f116cbdb559971a1e5a1de9e/2022-12/312570141_526218912845053_3212077087324754104_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭重返校園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a61623478bf4dd8a9d74f00d0d8ad6d/2022-12/54041379_10157109508036449_7682350346714218496_n_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭當時剛接受完骨膠原注射，擔心穿高跟鞋會影響膝蓋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b383941d931925eece0585e97953ec3/2022-12/KakaoTalk_20221207_191004007.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳淑蘭笑指自己年紀大，膝蓋痛，五十肩、富貴包都有。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a693c9baf6c324464c021b98f693cb5/2022-12/KakaoTalk_20221207_191001996.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑今年踏入新一年即宣布喜訊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23071139301a17ebc8a02d0c73ae4360/2025-01/david_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑再度成為人夫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbd9de33b8856ffdd51f99a100a5c844/2025-01/david_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑開心報喜：「隆重宣布我們結婚了！迎接美好未來。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5818e047e90c24c55b785477dc086812/2025-01/david_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑在IG分享婚紗相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4b471de0d9b933fbea8f278807064de/2025-01/david_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑與太太好合襯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d43602c985ebb2bec71117a7436d636/2025-01/david_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑大晒結婚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cdf0bd2646f320de274a9863cf3b53ec/2025-01/david_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑夫婦外型合襯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2db421b1d4092d82babcfc1119dfbbd8/2025-01/david_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑的婚照背景似在西班牙拍攝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67bdae401454528059b15dd0b99c8b2f/2025-01/david_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑與太太坐馬車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87b4eab5113c80184365d99925d0a352/2025-01/david_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑與太太在廣場起舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa22818160af51e76d984d59db1ce623/2025-01/david_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑夫婦坐私人飛機場度蜜月。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37473b095bfcd47b8255bc33042a2e73/2025-01/david_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑趁70歲前完成人生大事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f51a593fdc4b5a7d81df5051889aa91a/2025-01/david_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑與太太已火速度蜜月。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2fb2f201a08fbb7113884b1f61ae0283/2025-01/david_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑註冊後即去度假。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d82bc9c1e865c0523abf05fbf072231/2025-01/david_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑夫婦入住的地方有大泳池。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abd66cee2a3e50df326478a61c1b3e7f/2025-01/david_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑夫婦坐遊艇出海。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/317a82b402ddd524ace7b480239a40f8/2025-01/david_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"祁文傑夫婦去打高爾夫球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03c2dec62705a94c95eb5258a906937e/2025-01/david_16_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T10:59:03.188505+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":819,"images":65,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T14:38:15.662213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:57:37.393959+00:00","content_hash":"cf98c2bb18c1309bf3b9c3ed9d62511f6bdd6fac0df4a39ed9ade669abe28650","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}